# Distribution
RAMSES_ESP.indigoPlugin.zip

# Vendored dependencies — Indigo pip-installs these into the bundle at startup
# from requirements.txt, so they must NEVER be committed. Tracking them shipped
# a v1.5.0 zip carrying paho 1.6.1 AND a pip-success sentinel, so Indigo skipped
# the install and the plugin loaded 1.x code against a 2.x call — dead at
# startup. NOT root-anchored: a leading-slash pattern would not match inside
# the .indigoPlugin bundle (the ClaudeBridge lesson).
**/Contents/Packages/

# Claude Code context file — local only
CLAUDE.md

# Secrets — never commit; only IndigoSecrets_example.py is published
secrets.py
IndigoSecrets.py
**/secrets.py
**/IndigoSecrets.py

# Test runner artefacts
.pytest_cache/
